                    "Get minimum of n and i plus nums at i plus one, assign to end.",
                    "Loop from i plus one to end exclusive, assign to j.",
                    "Get minimum of dp at i and one plus dp at j, assign to dp at i.",
                    "Return dp at zero."
                  ]
